If this project were to be scaled to an enterprise level, here is what would be implemented:

Real-time Data Ingestion: Integration with live APIs (NASA, World Bank, OpenWeather) instead of simulated data.

PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB: Replacing SQLite for handling massive time-series data.

Advanced ML Models: Using custom LSTM/Prophet models for time-series forecasting instead of purely relying on LLMs.

Docker & Kubernetes: Containerizing the application for scalable cloud deployment.

Global 3D Map: Interactive geo-spatial heatmaps overlaying real-time satellite imagery.

