## 📖 Table of Contents
1. [About The Project](#-about-the-project)
2. [The 5 Prediction Domains](#-the-5-prediction-domains)
3. [System Architecture](#-system-architecture)
4. [How It Works (Data Flow)](#-how-it-works-data-flow)
